'''Giant PAC-MAN''' (巨大パックマン, ''Kyodai Pakkuman'', '''Gigantic Pac-Man''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Giant PAC-MAN
|image = E 783.png
|first appearance = [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
Don't scoff at this enemy. While easily defeated early on, his HP gets pretty high in later stages. In ROUND MAX, he has 2.4 million hp and 33333 dps, which can tear through your meatshields with ease, and his fast movement speed means any gap between you and him will be covered in an instant. However, Giant PAC-MAN has one glaring flaw you can exploit: Single Attack. This means that he has to rely on his supporting enemies to cover him in case there's too many units that would overwhelm him.

==Strategy==
Use disposable meatshields to exploit his single-target attacks and make them take the hits while you have high damaging backliners to chip him down. It's recommended to use [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] or [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] on later rounds to stall Giant PAC-MAN for much longer, and use any unit with good damage and disposability like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] to try and kill him. Ubers that outrange him and do good damage like any of the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] exclusives will greatly help with dealing with him.

