==Trivia==
*While Giant PAC-MAN looks identical to normal [[PAC-MAN (Special Cat)|PAC-MAN]] besides size, he's based off the form you get when you eat the power pellets in the original Pac-Man, where you can eat the ghosts that were trying to hunt you down to get more score.
*Unlike [[Kunio-kun (Uber Rare Cat)|Kunio-kun]] and [[High School Kingpin Riki (Uber Rare Cat)|High School Kingpin Riki]], Giant PAC-MAN's sprite in his knockback animation is rotated like a typical [[The Battle Cats|Battle Cats]] character instead of like an actual 8-bit sprite.

